{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"             ﻿\n \n こんばんは〜\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0HKTRR1N1F63GS98HFZ9TW","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0HKVW958PH6PVEPXRCYBA8","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n  \n  \n 12月に受けた世界遺産検定受かっていたのです〜👏\n \n \n やったーーー☺︎\n \n \n このようなご時世なので\n あちこちへと旅行に行くことは厳しいですが、\n 行けたときに何倍も楽しめるようにたくさん知識を詰めておきたいと思います〜！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n TGCでの櫻坂46 ミニライブを見てくださった皆さんありがとうございました！\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0HKWZ9CGQ7NXB1ESK4T9TH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0HKY3572N8P36TF0VXKC0Y","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0HKZ4ADGP8Z4XPH8SKZ76H","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0HM04KK8M8S24XW8SSRZA4","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n  \n そして最後になってしまいましたが、\n 2ndシングルも精一杯頑張りますので\n 是非楽しみに待っていてくださいー✨\n \n \n \n \n またね〜\n \n \n \n \n "},{"type":"image","src":"https://images.sakamichi.co/blogs/01JJ0HM154CAHTFCAE0BNRP6MH","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":">\n  \n  \n いえい✌︎\n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n あおい             "}],"source":"archive"}